# Systems Override {2}{R}: "Gain control of target artifact or creature until end of turn. Untap that permanent. It gains haste until end of turn. If it's a
# Spacecraft, put ten charge counters on it. If you do, remove ten charge counters from it at the beginning of the next end step." Bot2 casts Specimen
# Freighter (station 9+: a 4/7 flyer) and stations it once with Memnite, one charge counter, so it is no creature. On turn 3 Bot1 takes it: ten more counters
# make eleven, so it is a 4/7 flying artifact creature under Bot1, untapped and with haste, and attacks at once (Bot2 mills four from the attack trigger).
# At the end step exactly ten counters come off, leaving the one it had: the Freighter is back under Bot2 as no creature.

